		<segment id="104" parent="344" relname="span">but right now we 're thinking about him and his birthday .</segment>
		<segment id="105" parent="344" relname="organization-phatic">Okay .</segment>
		<segment id="106" parent="345" relname="span">And I got ta s- get started on this chicken pizza or ,</segment>
